DESC grantiva_screenshot :: Take a screenshot of the device (iOS simulator or Android emulator). Returns a base64-encoded PNG image.
DESC grantiva_tap :: Tap on a UI element by accessibility label or by coordinates. A label is matched against the accessibility label first; on iOS, when no element has that label, against the accessibility identifier (WD
DESC grantiva_swipe :: Swipe on the device (iOS simulator or Android emulator) screen. After swiping, returns the updated accessibility tree.
DESC grantiva_type :: Type text into the currently focused field on the device (iOS simulator or Android emulator). After typing, returns the updated accessibility tree.
DESC grantiva_a11y_check :: Run accessibility audit on the current screen. Checks for missing labels on interactive elements and tap targets smaller than 44pt (iOS) or 48dp (Android).
DESC grantiva_build :: Build the project: xcodebuild on iOS, Gradle on Android. Returns build result with success status, duration, warnings, and errors.
DESC grantiva_test :: Run the project's test suite using xcodebuild test (iOS only). Returns pass/fail counts and output.
DESC grantiva_sim_list :: List iOS simulators with their name, UDID, state (as simctl reports it), runtime (e.g. iOS 26.0), and availability (no when the simulator's runtime is not installed).
DESC grantiva_sim_boot :: Boot an iOS simulator by name or UDID. Returns the booted device info.
DESC grantiva_emulator_list :: List Android Virtual Devices with the serial of each one that is running.
DESC grantiva_emulator_boot :: Boot an Android emulator by AVD name, or use it if it is already running. Defaults to emulator in grantiva-android.yml.
DESC grantiva_context :: Get current project context: config, the device the UI tools act on (the runner session's simulator or emulator; without a session, the configured one), Xcode or Android SDK, and runner session status
